🔹 PART 3: String vs StringBuilder (Interview Gold)
Feature	String	StringBuilder
Mutability	❌ Immutable	✅ Mutable
Speed	Slow	Fast
Thread Safe	Yes	No
Loop Usage	❌ Avoid	✅ Preferred
DSA	❌	✅
🔹 PART 4: Time Complexity (Must Remember)
String

charAt() → O(1)

substring() → O(n)

equals() → O(n)

+ in loop → ❌ O(n²)

StringBuilder

append() → O(1) amortized

insert() → O(n)

delete() → O(n)

reverse() → O(n)

🔹 PART 5: Interview One-Liners (VERY IMPORTANT)

String is immutable, StringBuilder is mutable

Avoid String concatenation inside loops

Use StringBuilder for building strings

== compares reference, equals() compares content

String literals are stored in SCP

🔹 PART 6: Common Interview Traps

❌ Using String + inside loop
❌ Using == for string comparison
❌ Forgetting toString() after StringBuilder
❌ Ignoring substring cost
